[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "london-main 8.Bd3"]
[Name "The set-up: Black closes with ...c4"]

8... c4 { Hits the bishop and gains space on the queenside, but it takes all the pressure off d4. }
9. Bc2 { Stays on the diagonal that points at h7. }
9... b5
10. e4 { With d4 safe and the queenside closed, White breaks in the centre, the same plan as ever. [%cal Ge3e4] } *
